# Build context of deploy/Dockerfile (context = repository root). BuildKit reads this file
# because it sits next to the Dockerfile and is named after it; a plain `.dockerignore` here
# would be ignored. The Dockerfile copies only what it names; this keeps the context small and
# makes sure local data, secrets and build outputs never reach the image.

# Dependencies and build outputs (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage

# Local data, secrets, originals (never in git, never in the image)
.git
.env*
.data
**/.data
data
ddatabase
QuestClass-Source
QuestClass-Source.zip
.claude
.playwright-mcp

# Not needed to build the server image
docs
e2e/**
!e2e/package.json
tools/lesson-prep/**
!tools/lesson-prep/package.json
scripts
**/*.mp4
**/*.m4s
